- content_for :title, "Privacy"

%section.page-header
  .container
    %h1.page-header__title Privacy

.container.prose
  %p We collect as little as possible.
  %ul
    %li
      When you click through to a booking site we record which property and site, the dates you searched and the page
      you clicked on. We do not store your IP address or any identifier that could tell us who you are.
    %li The site sets only the technically necessary session cookie. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies.
    %li
      Booking sites set their own cookies once you arrive there, including to attribute your booking to us; their
      privacy policies apply.
    %li Map tiles are loaded from the map tile server, which receives your IP address like any web server would.
